[7795]="700734A9\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive Mûr Ghala Sârzai & Hunter's Guild Marks barter currency allowances.\n",
[7796]="7004D70C\n1\tRetrieve the token of peace from King Thorin's throne\tThe token of peace can be found on King Thorin III's throne. King Thorin has asked you to collect and deliver a token of peace to King Thranduil.\n2\tDeliver the token of peace to King Thranduil in Felegoth\tKing Thranduil can be found in Felegoth. You have been tasked with delivering King Thorin's token of peace to King Thranduil.\n3\tScouts can be found throughout Felegoth. King Thranduil has asked you to send scouts into Eryn Lasgalen to seek the Weeping Warrior. You should sent the scouts out as soon as you are able.\t\n4\tTalk to King Thranduil\tKing Thranduil can be found in Felegoth. You have sent many of King Thranduil's scouts into Eryn Lasgalen in search of the Weeping Warrior. You should return to King Thranduil.\n",
[7797]="700460B0\n1\tFind wild-growing kingsfoil (total: 8)\tSearch Minas Tirith for any kingsfoil growing wild.\n2\tBring the kingsfoil to Bergil\tBring the kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n",
[7798]="700460B1\n1\tAsk around for kingsfoil (total: 5)\tAsk people in Minas Tirith for any dried kingsfoil leaves they may have.\n2\tBring the kingsfoil to Bergil\tBring the dried kingsfoil you have found back to Bergil, outside of the Houses of Healing on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n",
[7799]="70009982\n1\tSteal a lucky stone\tAmon Môth is located to the west and south of the Eavespires, and the cairn Erchiel mentioned is somewhere on the northern outskirts of their camp. Erchiel has asked you to prove your cunning by stealing a lucky stone from one of the giants of Amon Môth.\n2\tBring the lucky stone to Erchiel at the Eavespires\tErchiel can be found at the Eavespires, east and north of Amon Môth, near the shoreline of Lake Evendim. You should bring the lucky stone back to Erchiel.\n",
[7800]="70054826\n1\tExecute the recipe for a Morgul pamphlet\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be bartered for from the Improved Recipes vendor. Draught a Morgul pamphlet.\n2\tTalk to Ethel Applegarth\030Turn in a Morgul pamphlet (quantity: see journal) to Ethel Applegarth\030Talk to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\030Turn in a Morgul pamphlet (quantity: see journal) to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[7801]="70054825\n1\tExecute the recipe for a Morgul report\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be bartered for from the Improved Recipes vendor. Draught a Morgul report.\n2\tTalk to Ethel Applegarth\030Turn in a Morgul report (quantity: see journal) to Ethel Applegarth\030Talk to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\030Turn in a Morgul report (quantity: see journal) to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[7802]="70054824\n1\tExecute the recipe for a Morgul Leadership Analysis Report\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be bartered for from the Improved Recipes vendor. Draught a Morgul Leadership Analysis Report.\n2\tTalk to Ethel Applegarth\030Turn in a Morgul Leadership Analysis Report (quantity: see journal) to Ethel Applegarth\030Talk to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\030Turn in a Morgul Leadership Analysis Report (quantity: see journal) to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[7803]="70054823\n1\tExecute the recipe for the Scholar's Guild Leader's Tincture of Relaxation\tThe crafting recipes you must create can be bartered for from the Improved Recipes vendor. Brew the Scholar's Guild Leader's Tincture of Relaxation.\n2\tTalk to Ethel Applegarth\030Turn in the Scholar's Guild Leader's Tincture of Relaxation (quantity: see journal) to Ethel Applegarth\030Talk to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\030Turn in Scholar's Guild Leader's Tincture of Relaxation (quantity: see journal) to the Scholar's Guild Leader in Minas Morgul\t\n",
[7804]="7001758F\n1\tBring the book to Winiel at the Rotting Cellar\030Defeat Greatroar and collect the book\tGreatroar is somewhere in the Water-works of Moria, far to the south of Rivendell. Mirwen told you to find the toad Greatroar and defeat her, for the toad long ago swallowed a book of dwarf-lore.\n",
[7805]="700544EE\n1\tFind the Kolos Gurz socket\tThe Kolos Gurz socket can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should take the seal there.\n2\tFind the Kolos Gurz socket\tThe Kolos Gurz socket can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should take the seal there.\n3\tFind the Kolos Gurz component\tThe Kolos Gurz component can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should find the component.\n4\tAdd the component to the Kolos Gurz socket\tThe Kolos Gurz socket can be found in Minas Morgul. You should take the component there.\n5\tCompleted\tYou have completed the Kolos Gurz.\n",
